00:28:14.390 --> 00:28:15.010
You hear me?

00:28:19.800 --> 00:28:25.120
Mr. Raymond, Mr. Raymond, we just found a watchman tied up in the basement, whispering shadows, tell him the alarm.

00:28:31.630 --> 00:28:35.160
He doesn't know what's happening!

00:28:35.490 --> 00:28:36.350
He just moved down!
